commit 282bb1a23471bde1e5a72e6f0ac34a13f10e9fab
Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:03:36 2026 +0330

    fix(qa4-img14,qa4-img27,qa4-img29): ppc budget badge, review split tolerance, true step counts
    
    - img14: PPC service cards/detail rows render budget_share
      (badge data-testid=ppc-budget-share via t('ppc.budgetShareBadge'),
      detail row after budget; aliases budget_share/_percent, 0-100
      validated) - backend now stamps it on all three lists (ad_creator
      commit b5b8a66) (types.ts:422-441,488-489,506-527).
    - img27: getStrategyBudgetSplit tolerates response_payload shapes
      funnel_campaigns / data.funnel_campaigns / data-as-payload; equal
      thirds fallback only when no strategy carries funnel data;
      by-platform view weighted by platform_recommendations.budget_share
      (types.ts:768-783,800).
    - img29/new5: getCampaignStepCounts includes the optional
      ad_generation_completed/visual_completed/review_completed flags
      (total up to 9) when the backend provides them; unchanged otherwise
      (types.ts:366-404).
    - types.test.ts 27->39; PpcServiceCard.test.ts 6 (new).

